reference/demo-scripts/

# Two of the reference snapshots are full git CLONES, not file copies:
# `git add reference/` would record them as gitlinks pointing at commits this repo
# does not contain, and a fresh clone would get two empty directories. They are
# local reading material (HARD RULE 7: read it, never edit it, never import it),
# so they stay out of the index entirely rather than half-in as a broken submodule.
reference/bulletproof-react/
reference/design-patterns-typescript/
